# Antar Architecture Rules

These rules apply to all work in the Antar repository.

## Required Source Material

Before meaningful architectural or product changes, inspect relevant canonical docs:

- `docs/architecture/01_SYSTEM_OVERVIEW.md`
- `docs/architecture/02_DOMAIN_MODEL.md`
- `docs/architecture/03_DATA_MODEL.md`
- `docs/architecture/04_API_CONTRACTS.md`
- `docs/architecture/05_AI_PIPELINE.md`
- `docs/architecture/06_RAG_ARCHITECTURE.md`
- `docs/architecture/07_SECURITY_AND_PRIVACY.md`
- `docs/architecture/08_DEPLOYMENT_AND_OBSERVABILITY.md`
